Hi=C2=A0Shubham,

=C2=A0

First of all, here comes the news all our readers and all founders and inve=
stors from across Europe have been waiting for desperately: Yes, the AC in =
our EU-Startups headquarter is finally working again! It only took 4 weeks =
to get it fixed... :)

=C2=A0

But wait, we have even more refreshing and cooler updates to share with you=
 this week. Here you go:

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=91=B6 **LinkedIn "Paternity" Poll:** This week, we launched a poll a=
sking if you would support your Co-founder in taking 6+ months of paternity=
 leave. 402 people voted so far. [The results](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.ne=
t/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfsTSz57aqxQDwjt4eorw9a/y-uXJqkDl5kL) might surprise y=
ou.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=93=A2 **New Milestone Reached:**Today, we=E2=80=99re about to hit 12=
5,000 followers for the [LinkedIn page of EU-Startups](https://4ntll.r.sp1-=
brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfuMSVaQZQBsGJ3hF1Jeg66/_GPq4a163aRm)! Thanks =
for being part of Europe=E2=80=99s most active startup community. Let=E2=80=
=99s keep growing together!

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=92=8A **HealthTech & MedTech Funding:**


- London-based [Numan](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfw=
FS25jXzQKIfNVPNoRQ2c/7P4P2yYntmR7) just raised =E2=82=AC51.6 million to adv=
ance digital, preventative men=E2=80=99s healthcare.=20
- British startup [Cryogenx](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1=
aA2nfy8RYb2WYemL1hJZkJE9z8/CLZgGvOW9PK8) secured =E2=82=AC1.9 million for t=
ech to combat extreme heat stress in military and industrial settings.=20
- French scale-up [Dreampath Diagnostics](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/=
cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng01R56LV7tENO17k6o0tve/2O2Pj4g4nHXh) received new investme=
nt to digitise anatomical pathology processes.=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=A5=A8 **Bits & Pretzels 2025:** Under the theme =E2=80=9CConnecting =
Europe,=E2=80=9D [Bits & Pretzels is back](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk=
/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng1uQbbeTh7gPkKvuTIndsA/3a5BWtklY6hY) for its 2025 edition=
, happening during Oktoberfest in Munich. Expect AI talks, startup-investor=
 matchmaking, and big names from tech, business and politics.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F **Cybersecurity Innovators:**=C2=A0


- Italian startup [Exein](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2=
ng3nQ86xSGM8S6ek4pnaNog/Gp_un6A2gRIK) secured =E2=82=AC70 million to build =
cybersecurity tools.=C2=A0=20
- Valencia-based[ Internxt](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1a=
A2ng5gPecGQpaaUSyYFCIN7lC/PXqazFlMn9XL) raised =E2=82=AC3.3 million to beco=
me the =E2=80=9Cethical alternative=E2=80=9D to Big Tech.=20
- Guardians of the grid: This week, we introduced you to 10 exceptionally p=
romising [European cybersecurity startups](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk=
/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng7ZPB7ZPOp2WpIMPYn9rhi/XCfUbXH_dM9T) that are keeping our=
 digital infrastructure safe.=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=92=A5 **Insolvency is not the end:** This week, Jonathan Bernwieser,=
 former CEO of Agrando and now Co-founder and CEO of EverLeaf, shares the [=
emotional and legal challenges](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7n=
VU1aA2ng9SOhcsNy3UZBcAZvHwbeE/t673hzhlDAya) he faced, lessons learned, myth=
s debunked, and much more.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=A7=A0 **AI Funding rounds of the week:**


- Berlin-based [MOTOR Ai](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJT=
Z6vLwtrlX4zfDnxx1VYGWkZ0/IZGz1-ETWedO) raised =E2=82=AC17.1 million to buil=
d Europe=E2=80=99s first certified autonomous vehicle fleet.=20
- Barcelona-based [Murphy](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJ=
TZ7390w51tATKzY7kAIRNmSB8/NmX5scpHujGk) secured =E2=82=AC12.8 million to fi=
x the =E2=80=9Cbroken industry=E2=80=9D of debt servicing with AI.=20
- Madrid-based [HaloTech](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJT=
Z7Aw4yIIFFx0lIHXJ5KV29nG/yhWDPkawlkaF) raised =E2=82=AC10 million to lead t=
he AI-driven industrial safety revolution.=20
- Copenhagen-based [Kiku](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJT=
Z7Ij90VYbLQgX2RKRsDcHrPO/5UHWkVOwuVX6) closed =E2=82=AC4 million in fresh f=
unding for its AI-powered recruitment platform.=20
- Munich-based [36ZERO](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7=
QWD2ioxQuMImb7af6jXZ1W/rzmM5UBt4y7m) Vision secured =E2=82=AC3.6 million fo=
r its data-efficient AI inspection platform.=20
- Stockholm-based [Opper A](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyX=
JTZ7YJH4w5JWO24WkujRzqnGde/7FImuY_PxdfA)I raised =E2=82=AC2.5 million to ma=
ke AI infrastructure more reliable, just like Stripe is for payments.=20
- London-based [Inntelo AI ](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzy=
XJTZ7g6L79LfbrhqGuhsEsy2yFm/FwJPQdoORiyx)raised over =E2=82=AC576k to grow =
its AI Concierge platform for hotels.=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=94=8B **Energy Innovators:**Tallinn-based [J=C3=A4lle Technologies](=
https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7ntP9Mc1hLNc14V11m5Ifru/s=
llKupaivsy0) just secured =E2=82=AC2 million to tackle the growing crisis o=
f electronic waste by repurposing dead batteries, and Berlin-based [ALVA En=
ergie](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7vgTBZsNmp3NlEI9of=
CYNU2/txqY1HX8nz8-) raised over =E2=82=AC5 million to scale decentralised e=
nergy solutions. And due to our recent bad experience with the office AC br=
eaking down, I hope there are some startups that will disrupt this space as=
 well. If you know some, let me know! :)

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=9B=A9=EF=B8=8F**FutureTravel Summit:**On October 30 we'll be gatheri=
ng 500 travel & hospitality leaders, founders and investors at this year's =
[FutureTravel Summit](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ83T=
XDn8jsIj9VO5IbYJo56A/jeOY67DhvNe3) in Barcelona. If you haven't secured you=
r ticket yet, we are giving away 3 tickets for EU-Startups readers this wee=
k! Try your luck, and respond to this email by sharing a link to your Linke=
dIn profile. The selection will be done tomorrow afternoon!=C2=A0

=C2=A0

**=F0=9F=92=A1 It=E2=80=99s Not You, It=E2=80=99s Us:** A new report reveal=
s some of the main reasons [why corporate-startup partnerships fall apart](=
https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ6vNptOGq3YtfqKGpfulJUVW/z=
yq4lUA-k7xp). According to research initiated by European Innovation Counci=
l (EIC), the problem usually isn=E2=80=99t a lack of ambition - it=E2=80=99=
s a lack of structure.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=92=B0 **Fresh VC Funds:** The Dutch VC [CapitalT](https://4ntll.r.sp=
1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ73AtvbXC92ZRaU3ySnsZC7e/yGm9LQEx_0BT) just =
announced the =E2=82=AC50 million first close of its Fund II to back divers=
e and driven early-stage founders, and Lisbon-based Ventures.eu announced t=
he 1st closing of [Ventures.eu Fund I](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/=
f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7AxxxonYEWFDKdr7Fgzotjm/CEkefSc5LbGZ), aimed at supporting ea=
rly-stage startups across Portugal and Europe.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=8E=A7 **EU-Startups Podcast:**This week, we were joined by [Trevor N=
eff,](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7Il2023uJzuz4neG2a7=
4bLu/YCKhBwrtvK0V) Partner at Headline Growth, a global VC firm that has ra=
ised over $865 million for its fourth growth fund, with half of it dedicate=
d to Europe.

=C2=A0

That's it for today. Have a nice rest of the week, whether you are working =
hard, or hardly working, sipping cocktails at a pool. :)

=C2=A0

Sunny greetings,

Thomas
