Hi=C2=A0Shubham,

=C2=A0

I hope you're having a great week so far! To make it even better, here are =
some fresh opportunities, insights and news related to startups and venture=
 capital in Europe:

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=A5=97 **Future Foods Lab:******Applications are now open for Nomad F=
oods=E2=80=99 Future Foods Lab, a bold new Venture Clienting program launch=
ed in partnership with global innovation network Innoget. The program invit=
es startups with market-ready solutions to tackle key business challenges, =
with the potential to pilot and scale across Europe. [Register](https://4nt=
ll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfsTSz57aqxQDwjt4eorw9a/j5Sz3BHbqnUh)=
 for their upcoming webinar, learn more, and apply!

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=92=8A **Health & BioTech Innovators:=C2=A0**


- Bulgarian HealthTech provider [Blue Longevity Clinic](https://4ntll.r.sp1=
-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfuMSVaQZQBsGJ3hF1Jeg66/bjlqsA5GkVD-) raised =
=E2=82=AC2 million to help you live longer.=20
- Estonian BioTech developer [=C3=84IO](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl=
/f/sh/7nVU1aA2nfwFS25jXzQKIfNVPNoRQ2c/cun654j_wAJB) secured =E2=82=AC1 mill=
ion to create greener alternatives for cosmetics.=20
- Are you curious about HealthTech innovations? Make sure to subscribe to o=
ur weekly [HealthHack newsletter](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/=
7nVU1aA2nfy8RYb2WYemL1hJZkJE9z8/ReFAe_va3hZL).=20
- Swiss BioTech innovator [ASTRA Therapeutics](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.ne=
t/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng01R56LV7tENO17k6o0tve/_WgRfPETa7lS) today announced =
=E2=82=AC8.3 million in fresh funding to advance precision Parasiticides fo=
r animal health.=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=A7=A0 **AI Funding Rounds of the Week:**


- Stockholm-based[ Lovable](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1a=
A2ng1uQbbeTh7gPkKvuTIndsA/sc3xl7CetNVU) has just become the fastest-growing=
 software company ever, skyrocketing to $100 million ARR in just 8 months.=
=20
- London-based[ Bitfount](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2=
ng3nQ86xSGM8S6ek4pnaNog/WDuAUZPiAjAb) raised =E2=82=AC6.8 million to break =
down clinical research data silos with its federated AI network.=20
- London-based [Magentic](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2=
ng5gPecGQpaaUSyYFCIN7lC/BFQcOVLCDcfK) secured =E2=82=AC4.6 million to scale=
 enterprise automation by deploying AI agents into the supply chain.=20
- Stuttgart-based=C2=A0[Makersite](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh=
/7nVU1aA2ng7ZPB7ZPOp2WpIMPYn9rhi/KCac8ce4zc75) raised =E2=82=AC60 million t=
o accelerate product sustainability through AI during the design process=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=8E=AF **Ready to fast-track compliance** for SOC 2, ISO 27001, or GD=
PR? Join Vanta=E2=80=99s on-demand product demo to see how 7,000+ companies=
 automate security and save hundreds of hours on audit prep. [Learn how to =
get compliant in weeks](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/7nVU1aA2ng=
9SOhcsNy3UZBcAZvHwbeE/JFQlsMO17Fae), not months - without slowing down your=
 team.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=92=B0 **VC Funds for Female Founders:**Berlin=E2=80=99s [Auxxo](http=
s://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ6vLwtrlX4zfDnxx1VYGWkZ0/7QEpW=
qGfi1ZR) just raised =E2=82=AC26 million to invest exclusively in teams wit=
h at least one female founder. And our friends at Tech Funding News just pu=
blished a piece about why women still seem to be [shut out of European VC](=
https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7390w51tATKzY7kAIRNmSB8/L=
s-nEW7AiWZY).

=C2=A0

=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F **Passion vs. Money:**Earlier this week we asked our Lin=
kedIn followers "Who do you think is more likely to succeed: Founders with =
a strong passion for their industry/product or founders with a strong drive=
 to make money?" Here are the [results and comments](https://4ntll.r.sp1-br=
evo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7Aw4yIIFFx0lIHXJ5KV29nG/DhocdNjjP3IF).

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=8C=B1 **GreenTech Innovators:=C2=A0**


- London-based [Sunsave](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ=
7Ij90VYbLQgX2RKRsDcHrPO/3jP3t-BTQwPp) banked =E2=82=AC130 million to take s=
olar mainstream with a zero-upfront subscription model.=20
- Swiss startup [Jaipur Robotics](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/=
WCPzyXJTZ7QWD2ioxQuMImb7af6jXZ1W/Ip82RP5Zx-nN) secured =E2=82=AC161K to sol=
ve inefficiencies in waste-to-energy.=20
- London=E2=80=99s [Fuse Energy](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/W=
CPzyXJTZ7YJH4w5JWO24WkujRzqnGde/x6_IyvLUQEa4) raised an additional =E2=82=
=AC8.5 million to build the world=E2=80=99s first renewable giant.=20
=C2=A0

=F0=9F=9B=A1=EF=B8=8F **GDPR Impact:** Yesterday, we asked our LinkedIn fol=
lowers "Do you think GDPR had a positive impact on data privacy and data pr=
otection in Europe so far?" [The results](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/=
cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7g6L79LfbrhqGuhsEsy2yFm/G1eyv5l-QIQB) might surprise you..=
. :)

=C2=A0

**=E2=9C=85 You're currently hiring?**Make sure to check out our [EU-Startu=
ps Job Board](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7ntP9Mc1hLN=
c14V11m5Ifru/Izo4iUU5No29), and give it a try for free. In case of any tech=
nical issues or questions, please just reply to this email.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=8E=A7 **EU-Startups Podcast:**This week we published two exciting ep=
isodes. In [Episode 128](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ=
7vgTBZsNmp3NlEI9ofCYNU2/fkobxD4G0zqy), Wouter Durville (Co-founder & CEO of=
 TestGorilla) shares how the company is making recruitment fairer, faster a=
nd more inclusive and in [Episode 127](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/=
f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ83TXDn8jsIj9VO5IbYJo56A/5Y8lJ8jlVkXg), Antonio Esc=C3=A1rzaga=
 and David Cend=C3=B3n Garc=C3=ADa from the EU-Startups editorial team expl=
ore the evolution of startup media, from the rise of AI-generated content t=
o what makes a story stand out today.

=C2=A0

=F0=9F=9A=A2 **Everyone on board:** Today, we dove deep into the future of =
travel and hospitality, showcasing 10 promising [European TravelTech startu=
ps](https://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ6vNptOGq3YtfqKGpfulJU=
VW/dc9HLoYOo84s) reimagining how we move, book and explore. Also, if you're=
 curious about the latest in TravelTech, the [FutureTravel Summit 2025](htt=
ps://4ntll.r.sp1-brevo.net/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ73AtvbXC92ZRaU3ySnsZC7e/I41s=
AexaMMwf) is just around the corner!

=C2=A0

That's all I had to share with you today=C2=A0Shubham. Have a nice rest of =
the day/week, and soon a lovely weekend! :)

=C2=A0

Sunny greetings,

Thomas
